      "docs": "Helper functions for running the clear replacement shader for specific resource types, values types and number of channels.\nCan be used from inside RHIs via FRHICommandList_RecursiveHazardous. ResourceBindCallback is provided to allow the RHI to override\nhow the UAV resource is bound to the underlying platform context.."
